奏","text":"董昭表言武帝征鲁阳平之险幸而克","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-f4ff8b89230da169b39e","label":"裴注·魏名臣奏","text":"杨暨表言征鲁对兵三日欲还鲁守自坏","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-7fc2c40720129e9ed48e"]},{"id":"gongsuntao-a-7b78046bf6dc265d243a","label":"裴注·世语","text":"野麋突坏卫营高祚等夜会众卫惧遂降","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-2aea4a3865cb2c2daf3c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"遣兵夜袭","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0346","role":"夜袭","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0347","role":"被斩","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0344","role":"逃走","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0279","role":"出奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},{"person":"guanzhang-p0036","role":"又曰今以迫往功必轻不如依杜濩赴朴胡相拒然后委质功必多","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0349","role":"被劝所依者","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0348","role":"被劝所赴者","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0"]},{"person":"wudi-p0122","role":"表曰武皇帝承凉州从事及武都降人之辞说张鲁易攻信以为然、及往临履不如所闻乃叹曰他人商度少如人意","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"故大将军、受遣呼山上兵还、前自见乃还白武皇帝","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0015","role":"将军、同受遣呼山上兵还","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"侍中、在兵后语惇褚言官兵已据得贼要屯贼已散走","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"wendi-p0071","role":"侍中、同语惇褚","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0055","role":"表曰武皇帝始征张鲁以十万之众身亲临履指授方略因就民麦以为军粮","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-7fc2c40720129e9ed48e"]}],"place":{"text":"阳平、巴中","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安二十年秋七月","year":215,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o176b-q","wudi-q-o173","wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab"],"chronology":"wudi-y215","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o173","basis":"建安二十年秋七月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,998,"O176b"],"order":374}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0347","name":"杨任","evidence":["wudi-q-o176"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o176-wudi-p0347","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o176"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-2aea4a3865cb2c2daf3c","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-4d77a48001960371679e","layer":"pei","quote":"夜有野麋数千突坏卫营，军大惊。夜，高祚等误与卫众遇，祚等多鸣鼓角会众。卫惧，以为大军见掩，遂降","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":309,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c873df6029964ad38a0","start":99,"end":146,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-6bab1ba78435eeef70cc","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-6a1c95ed57c00b446116","layer":"original","quote":"鲁欲举汉中降；其弟卫不肯，率众数万人拒关坚守","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-7fc2c40720129e9ed48e","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-1954f1577f0c58b22fca","layer":"pei","quote":"又杨暨表曰：“武皇帝始征张鲁，以十万之众，身亲临履，指授方略，因就民麦以为军粮。张卫之守，盖不足言，地险守易；虽有精兵虎将，势不能施。对兵三日，欲抽军还，言：‘作军三十年，一朝持与人，如何？’此计已定，天祚大魏，鲁守自坏，因以定之","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":308,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c873df6029964ad38a0","start":0,"end":115,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-b3d5c19d61f972ae0ce9","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-9ba8257c047e00b51042","layer":"pei","quote":"武皇帝，承凉州从事及武都降人之辞，说‘张鲁易攻，阳平城下南北山相远，不可守也’，信以为然。及往临履，不如所闻，乃叹曰：‘他人商度，少如人意！’攻阳平山上诸屯，既不时拔，士卒伤夷者多。武皇帝意沮，便欲拔军，截山而还。遣故大将军夏侯惇、将军许褚，呼山上兵还。会前军未还，夜迷惑；误入贼营，贼便退散。侍中辛毗、刘晔等在兵后，语惇、褚，言：‘官兵已据得贼要屯，贼已散走。’犹不信之，惇前自见，乃还白武皇帝。进兵定之，幸而克获。此近事，吏士所知","attribution":"裴注·魏名臣奏","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c873df6029964ad38a0","start":16,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-bb09dcc2706efd4bbfa0","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-6a1c95ed57c00b446116","layer":"original","quote":"鲁闻阳平已陷，将稽颡〖10〗。圃又曰：“今以迫往〖11〗，功必轻；不如依杜（灌）〔濩〕赴朴胡相拒，然后委质〖12〗，功必多。”于是乃奔南山入巴中","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o176b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-889ba56c5491dd0a8600","layer":"original","quote":"贼见大军退，其守备解散。公乃密遣解(、高祚等乘险夜袭。大破之，斩其将杨任。进攻卫，卫等夜遁；鲁溃，奔巴中〖11〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0a96bdd9353a663e5ab","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十年：建安二十年（公元 215 ）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":328,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3bb2f11071aab1690790","start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o173","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fc2c779b81f1c3c13b40","layer":"original","quote":"二十年春正月〖1〗，天子立公中女为皇后〖2〗。省云中、定襄、五原、朔方郡〖3〗，郡置一县领其民；合以为新兴郡〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o176","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-889ba56c5491dd0a8600","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，公至阳平〖10〗。张鲁使弟卫与将杨昂等据阳平关，横山筑城十余里。攻之不能拔，乃引军还。贼见大军退，其守备解散。公乃密遣解(、高祚等乘险夜袭。大破之，斩其将杨任。进攻卫，卫等夜遁；鲁溃，奔巴中〖11〗。公军入南郑〖12〗，尽得鲁府库珍宝。﹝二﹞巴、汉皆降〖13〗。复汉宁郡为汉中；分汉中之安阳、西城为西城郡〖14〗，置太守；分锡、上庸（郡）〖15〗，置都尉。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":182,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o045a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-1f07331b166b6f2880a1","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，曹公定汉中，张鲁遁走巴西。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
